{
  "info": {
    "name": "Learning Analytics Microservices",
    "description": "Colección completa de la API REST de la plataforma de Learning Analytics.\n\n## Microservicios incluidos\n\n1. **Identity Service** (`:8000` vía Gateway) — autenticación con JWT\n2. **Event Ingestion** (`:8002`) — recepción de eventos LMS\n3. **Telemetry Processing** (`:8003`) — métricas agregadas\n4. **Alerting Service** (`:8004`) — reglas e incidentes\n5. **Notification Dispatcher** (`:8005`) — notificaciones multi-canal\n\n## Cómo usar\n\n1. Selecciona el environment **Learning Analytics - Local**\n2. Ejecuta **Auth → Login (admin)** — el JWT se guarda automáticamente en la variable `JWT_TOKEN`\n3. El resto de requests usa `{{JWT_TOKEN}}` automáticamente\n\n## Casos de uso pre-armados\n\nEn la carpeta **🧪 Demo Flows** hay secuencias de 3-5 requests que ejercitan flujos completos (ej: disparar incidente y consultar notificaciones generadas).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔑 Auth (Identity Service)",
      "description": "Autenticación JWT. El login guarda el token en la variable `JWT_TOKEN` automáticamente.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (data.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('JWT_TOKEN', data.token);",
                  "    console.log('✓ JWT_TOKEN guardado:', data.token.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (data.user && data.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('USER_ID', data.user.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Token present', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('token'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@learning.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_GATEWAY}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{BASE_GATEWAY}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (docente)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('JWT_TOKEN', pm.response.json().token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"docente@learning.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_GATEWAY}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{BASE_GATEWAY}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (estudiante)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('JWT_TOKEN', pm.response.json().token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"estudiante@learning.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_GATEWAY}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{BASE_GATEWAY}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get current user (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_GATEWAY}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{BASE_GATEWAY}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_GATEWAY}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{BASE_GATEWAY}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📥 Event Ingestion",
      "description": "Recepción de eventos LMS. Cada endpoint aplica un Anti-Corruption Layer específico que normaliza el payload al modelo canónico antes de publicar a Kafka.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_INGESTION}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{BASE_INGESTION}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ingest Moodle event (course_viewed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Institution-Id", "value": "{{INSTITUTION_ID}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eventname\": \"\\\\core\\\\event\\\\course_viewed\",\n  \"userid\": 42,\n  \"courseid\": 7,\n  \"timecreated\": {{$timestamp}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_INGESTION}}/api/events/moodle",
              "host": ["{{BASE_INGESTION}}"],
              "path": ["api", "events", "moodle"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ingest Canvas event",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Institution-Id", "value": "{{INSTITUTION_ID}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event_name\": \"assignment_submitted\",\n  \"user_id\": 42,\n  \"context_id\": 7,\n  \"timestamp\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_INGESTION}}/api/events/canvas",
              "host": ["{{BASE_INGESTION}}"],
              "path": ["api", "events", "canvas"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ingest Open edX event",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Institution-Id", "value": "{{INSTITUTION_ID}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event_type\": \"problem_check\",\n  \"username\": \"student42\",\n  \"course_id\": \"course-v1:UNAB+CS101+2026\",\n  \"time\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_INGESTION}}/api/events/openedx",
              "host": ["{{BASE_INGESTION}}"],
              "path": ["api", "events", "openedx"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get recent events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_INGESTION}}/api/events/recent?limit=10",
              "host": ["{{BASE_INGESTION}}"],
              "path": ["api", "events", "recent"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📊 Telemetry Processing",
      "description": "Métricas agregadas. Ventanas de 1 minuto calculadas por el worker de telemetría sobre los eventos consumidos de Kafka.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_TELEMETRY}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{BASE_TELEMETRY}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics summary (KPIs globales)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_TELEMETRY}}/api/metrics/summary",
              "host": ["{{BASE_TELEMETRY}}"],
              "path": ["api", "metrics", "summary"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics windows (últimas 50)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_TELEMETRY}}/api/metrics/windows?limit=50",
              "host": ["{{BASE_TELEMETRY}}"],
              "path": ["api", "metrics", "windows"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "50" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics by LMS",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_TELEMETRY}}/api/metrics/by-lms",
              "host": ["{{BASE_TELEMETRY}}"],
              "path": ["api", "metrics", "by-lms"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🚨 Alerting Service",
      "description": "Reglas de detección e incidentes. Las reglas pueden ser stream (R1, R2) o batch (R3).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_ALERTING}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{BASE_ALERTING}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List rules",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_ALERTING}}/api/rules",
              "host": ["{{BASE_ALERTING}}"],
              "path": ["api", "rules"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Toggle rule active/inactive",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_ALERTING}}/api/rules/1/toggle-active",
              "host": ["{{BASE_ALERTING}}"],
              "path": ["api", "rules", "1", "toggle-active"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List all incidents",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (data.incidents && data.incidents.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('LAST_INCIDENT_ID', data.incidents[0].incident_id);",
                  "    console.log('✓ LAST_INCIDENT_ID guardado:', data.incidents[0].incident_id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_ALERTING}}/api/incidents",
              "host": ["{{BASE_ALERTING}}"],
              "path": ["api", "incidents"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List critical incidents (filter)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_ALERTING}}/api/incidents?severity=critical&status=notified",
              "host": ["{{BASE_ALERTING}}"],
              "path": ["api", "incidents"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "severity", "value": "critical" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "notified" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get incident by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_ALERTING}}/api/incidents/{{LAST_INCIDENT_ID}}",
              "host": ["{{BASE_ALERTING}}"],
              "path": ["api", "incidents", "{{LAST_INCIDENT_ID}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Acknowledge incident",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"acknowledged_by\": \"admin@learning.test\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_ALERTING}}/api/incidents/{{LAST_INCIDENT_ID}}/acknowledge",
              "host": ["{{BASE_ALERTING}}"],
              "path": ["api", "incidents", "{{LAST_INCIDENT_ID}}", "acknowledge"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Resolve incident",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"resolved_by\": \"admin@learning.test\",\n  \"resolution_notes\": \"Resuelto manualmente desde Postman para demo.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_ALERTING}}/api/incidents/{{LAST_INCIDENT_ID}}/resolve",
              "host": ["{{BASE_ALERTING}}"],
              "path": ["api", "incidents", "{{LAST_INCIDENT_ID}}", "resolve"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
